<title>USA: CCC buys 40,000 tonnes US white wheat for Pakistan.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 40,000 tonnes US white wheat for Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said Wednesday it bought 40,000 tonnes of U.S. soft white wheat for export to Pakistan, February 20-March 15 delivery.</p>
<p>It bought 17,250 tonnes from Louis Dreyfus Corp for $150.08 per tonne, FOB Portland, 11,500 tonnes from United Grain Co for $149.91, FOB Vancouver, and 11,250 tonnes from United Grain Co for $150.47, FOB Vancouver.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
